$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Defend and Destroy\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Earth\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Not Too Bad\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Day\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The United State's multifront attack presses on, and a soviet outpost lies in their way. The Soviets have other plans for the Americans, however.  The Americans must destroy 2 generators in the soviet base to leave them helpless and cut off, while the Soviets must prevent this." @
